{"parse":{"title":"核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day1（文末有惊喜！）","pageid":3123,"revid":6668,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A0%B8%E8%81%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E8%8A%82-%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%AB%99_Day1%EF%BC%88%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AB%E6%9C%89%E6%83%8A%E5%96%9C%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A0%B8%E8%81%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E8%8A%82-%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%AB%99_Day1%EF%BC%88%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AB%E6%9C%89%E6%83%8A%E5%96%9C%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%89&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A0%B8%E8%81%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E8%8A%82-%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%AB%99_Day1%EF%BC%88%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AB%E6%9C%89%E6%83%8A%E5%96%9C%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%89&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%B0%E9%97%BB\" title=\"新闻\">新闻</a> &gt; <b>核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day1（文末有惊喜！）</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E6.A0.B8.E8.81.9A.E5.8F.98.E6.B8.B8.E6.88.8F.E8.8A.82-.E5.8C.97.E4.BA.AC.E7.AB.99_Day1.EF.BC.88.E6.96.87.E6.9C.AB.E6.9C.89.E6.83.8A.E5.96.9C.EF.BC.81.EF.BC.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"核聚变游戏节-北京站_Day1（文末有惊喜！）\">核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day1（文末有惊喜！）</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A0%B8%E8%81%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E8%8A%82-%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%AB%99_Day1%EF%BC%88%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AB%E6%9C%89%E6%83%8A%E5%96%9C%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day1（文末有惊喜！）\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：在北京的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-09-09 18:50<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FqZ6msIIfdnJCpmoyW-S4lw\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qZ6msIIfdnJCpmoyW-S4lw</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息192.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF192.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"200\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>团长好！<br />\n在<font color=\"brown\"><b>北京核聚变游戏节</b></font>的第一天顺利结束啦<br />\n咔嚓咔嚓——记录现场的快门声不停<br />\n一起来和小场记回顾<font color=\"brown\"><b>精彩的瞬间</b></font>吧！\n<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息193.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/rwgw8ms3eyalw0mr19qmdduis3duz4m.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF193.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/rwgw8ms3eyalw0mr19qmdduis3duz4m.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF193.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/ff/rwgw8ms3eyalw0mr19qmdduis3duz4m.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>一大早，展台就排满了好多好多团长~</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息194.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/5n6dyl5u4bfylp08v8t6b9lbq6556a5.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF194.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/5n6dyl5u4bfylp08v8t6b9lbq6556a5.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF194.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/ff/5n6dyl5u4bfylp08v8t6b9lbq6556a5.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>为团长们准备了伊利亚行为指南，体验不迷路</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息195.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c7/09n3aop44wekek9e4kc31ik3fs2db7q.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF195.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c7/09n3aop44wekek9e4kc31ik3fs2db7q.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF195.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/09n3aop44wekek9e4kc31ik3fs2db7q.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"718\" />\n<small><small><small>《铃兰之剑》中文配音导演@张琦 现场试玩</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息196.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/2e/fe2tj1p2bwrezzroxdcefb8o750wre2.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF196.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/2e/fe2tj1p2bwrezzroxdcefb8o750wre2.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF196.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/2e/fe2tj1p2bwrezzroxdcefb8o750wre2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>玩家Wiki：@曜灵 也来到了铃兰之剑展台</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息197.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8a/l04measo2o74qyquljeb2mi5kylxq6i.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF197.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8a/l04measo2o74qyquljeb2mi5kylxq6i.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF197.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8a/l04measo2o74qyquljeb2mi5kylxq6i.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"718\" />\n<small><small><small>捕获一只B站UP主：@一杯气泡猹 前来体验游戏</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息198.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b2/aj8pp8ovw8ksk1l8tk1yl8360sygvyy.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF198.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b2/aj8pp8ovw8ksk1l8tk1yl8360sygvyy.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF198.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b2/aj8pp8ovw8ksk1l8tk1yl8360sygvyy.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>B站UP主：@谜之声 也来试玩铃兰之剑啦</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息199.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/62/gpzgayd7fbf8y321k382kwd8ovelcfs.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF199.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/62/gpzgayd7fbf8y321k382kwd8ovelcfs.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF199.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/62/gpzgayd7fbf8y321k382kwd8ovelcfs.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>现场体验游戏的团长</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息200.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/88/1qx25ts9xbjxkxk96d050a366xpzliv.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/88/1qx25ts9xbjxkxk96d050a366xpzliv.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF200.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/88/1qx25ts9xbjxkxk96d050a366xpzliv.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"718\" />\n<small><small><small>与朋友一起铃兰之剑，更开心！</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息201.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0e/krqm0w0nxtfsegwqly12cpkw52b1vja.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF201.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0e/krqm0w0nxtfsegwqly12cpkw52b1vja.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF201.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0e/krqm0w0nxtfsegwqly12cpkw52b1vja.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>工作人员献上耐心引导</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息202.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/41izrlzi620qmvfr1tkptdd37avf83o.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF202.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/41izrlzi620qmvfr1tkptdd37avf83o.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF202.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/78/41izrlzi620qmvfr1tkptdd37avf83o.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>回馈各位团长的精美角色立牌</small></small></small><br /><br />\n</p>\n</center>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">场记小报</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>北京的雨天盖不住团长们的热情，前来体验的团长超出了我们的想象，非常感谢各位的支持（鞠躬——<br /><br />\n在现场，场记看到了非常非常多有趣的瞬间。有的团长沉迷游戏，<font color=\"brown\"><b>忘却了旁边放着的手机打进来的电话</b></font>；有的自己体验完，又<font color=\"brown\"><b>带着朋友来开启了极限狗托模式</b></font>（x<br /><br />\n团长与我们的爱是<font color=\"brown\"><b>双向奔赴</b></font>的。这次核聚变让小场记深深感受到了各位对于铃兰之剑的<font color=\"brown\"><b>期待与热爱，热泪盈眶</b></font>的同时，场记决定给大家<font color=\"brown\"><b>偷跑</b></font>一个消息：<br /><br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><font color=\"brown\"><b>《铃兰之剑》</b></font>\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>将于9月底开启极心测试！</b></font>\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><br /><br />\n更多消息请持续关注小场记后续报道~多多期待吧ヽ( ω` )\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息203.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8b/0bv2t3dvwp13vhvhsnzv453m80beppv.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF203.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"996\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8b/0bv2t3dvwp13vhvhsnzv453m80beppv.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF203.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8b/0bv2t3dvwp13vhvhsnzv453m80beppv.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163729\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 109/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2752/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.597      1 -total\n 51.90%   17.436      1 模板:面包屑\n 47.69%   16.024      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3123-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163729 and revision id 6668. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"新闻","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息192.png","官方消息175.png","官方消息193.jpg","官方消息194.jpg","官方消息195.jpg","官方消息196.jpg","官方消息197.jpg","官方消息198.jpg","官方消息199.jpg","官方消息200.jpg","官方消息201.jpg","官方消息202.jpg","官方消息203.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day1（文末有惊喜！）","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"核聚变游戏节-北京站_Day1（文末有惊喜！）","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"核聚变游戏节-北京站_Day1（文末有惊喜！）"}],"displaytitle":"核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day1（文末有惊喜！）","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|新闻}}\n=核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day1（文末有惊喜！）=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=新闻\n|时间=2023-09-09 18:50\n|作者=在北京的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qZ6msIIfdnJCpmoyW-S4lw\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<br>\n[[file:官方消息192.png|560px|link=]]\n<br><br>\n<center>\n团长好！<br>\n在<font color=brown>'''北京核聚变游戏节'''</font>的第一天顺利结束啦<br>\n咔嚓咔嚓——记录现场的快门声不停<br>\n一起来和小场记回顾<font color=brown>'''精彩的瞬间'''</font>吧！\n<br>\n[[file:官方消息175.png|560px|link=]]\n<br>\n[[file:官方消息193.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>一大早，展台就排满了好多好多团长~</small></small></small><br><br>\n[[file:官方消息194.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>为团长们准备了伊利亚行为指南，体验不迷路</small></small></small><br><br>\n[[file:官方消息195.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>《铃兰之剑》中文配音导演@张琦 现场试玩</small></small></small><br><br>\n[[file:官方消息196.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>玩家Wiki：@曜灵 也来到了铃兰之剑展台</small></small></small><br><br>\n[[file:官方消息197.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>捕获一只B站UP主：@一杯气泡猹 前来体验游戏</small></small></small><br><br>\n[[file:官方消息198.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>B站UP主：@谜之声 也来试玩铃兰之剑啦</small></small></small><br><br>\n[[file:官方消息199.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>现场体验游戏的团长</small></small></small><br><br>\n[[file:官方消息200.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>与朋友一起铃兰之剑，更开心！</small></small></small><br><br>\n[[file:官方消息201.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>工作人员献上耐心引导</small></small></small><br><br>\n[[file:官方消息202.jpg|560px|link=]]\n<small><small><small>回馈各位团长的精美角色立牌</small></small></small><br><br>\n</center>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">场记小报</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n\n北京的雨天盖不住团长们的热情，前来体验的团长超出了我们的想象，非常感谢各位的支持（鞠躬——<br><br>\n在现场，场记看到了非常非常多有趣的瞬间。有的团长沉迷游戏，<font color=brown>'''忘却了旁边放着的手机打进来的电话'''</font>；有的自己体验完，又<font color=brown>'''带着朋友来开启了极限狗托模式'''</font>（x<br><br>\n团长与我们的爱是<font color=brown>'''双向奔赴'''</font>的。这次核聚变让小场记深深感受到了各位对于铃兰之剑的<font color=brown>'''期待与热爱，热泪盈眶'''</font>的同时，场记决定给大家<font color=brown>'''偷跑'''</font>一个消息：<br><br><br>\n<center>\n<font color=brown>'''《铃兰之剑》'''</font>\n<font color=brown>'''将于9月底开启极心测试！'''</font>\n</center>\n<br><br>\n更多消息请持续关注小场记后续报道~多多期待吧ヽ( ω` )\n<br><br>\n[[file:官方消息203.png|560px|link=]]\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:30.098174+00:00"}